{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/AdaUtils\/documentation\/AdaUtils\/EnvironmentKey","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"symbolKind":"protocol","externalID":"s:8AdaUtils14EnvironmentKeyP","modules":[{"name":"AdaUtils"}],"fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EnvironmentKey","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"EnvironmentKey","roleHeading":"Protocol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"EnvironmentKey","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol"},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"A key for accessing values in the environment.","type":"text"}],"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdaUtils\/documentation\/AdaUtils\/EnvironmentKey\/Value"],"anchor":"Associated-Types","title":"Associated Types"},{"title":"Type Properties","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdaUtils\/documentation\/AdaUtils\/EnvironmentKey\/defaultValue"],"anchor":"Type-Properties"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AdaUtils\/documentation\/AdaUtils"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"EnvironmentKey"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can create custom environment values by extending the "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaUtils\/documentation\/AdaUtils\/EnvironmentValues"},{"type":"text","text":" structure with new properties."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"First declare a new environment key type and specify a value for the required defaultValue property:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["private struct MyEnvironmentKey: EnvironmentKey {","    static let defaultValue: String = \"Default value\"","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Then use the key to define a new environment value property:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["extension EnvironmentValues {","    var myCustomValue: String {","        get { self[MyEnvironmentKey.self] }","        set { self[MyEnvironmentKey.self] = newValue }","    }","}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Clients of your environment value never use the key directly. Instead, they use the key path of your"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"custom environment value property. To set the environment value for a view and all its subviews,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"add the "},{"code":"View\/environment(_:_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" view modifier to that view:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["MyView()","   .environment(\\.myCustomValue, \"Another string\")"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"To read the value from inside MyView or one of its descendants, use the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Environment"},{"text":" property wrapper:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["struct MyView: View {","    @Environment(\\.myCustomValue) var customValue: String","","    var body: some View {","        Text(customValue) \/\/ Displays \"Another string\".","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/adautils\/environmentkey"]}],"references":{"doc://AdaUtils/documentation/AdaUtils/EnvironmentKey/Value":{"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","required":true,"title":"Value","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"associatedtype"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Value"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s8SendableP","text":"Sendable"}],"abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaUtils\/documentation\/AdaUtils\/EnvironmentKey\/Value","url"